<title>UK: London Intl H1 profit, dividend jumps.</title>
<headline>London Intl H1 profit, dividend jumps.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		1.93		   vs 1.43</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.7		    vs 0.5</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-exceps     9.5		    vs 6.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   158.1		  vs 139.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Healthcare company and condom specialist London International Group Plc said that adjusted for acquisitions, sales in its core business rose by a comparable 12 percent.  </p>
<p> Exceptional costs	8.4		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Operating profit	 4.1		    vs 9.3</p>
<p> Disposal gain	    0.2		    vs nil</p>
<p> Interest paid	    3.0		    vs 2.8</p>
<p> Tax			  2.7		    vs 1.6</p>
<p> Net taxed	   loss 1.4		    vs 4.9 profit</p>
<p> Attributable	loss 1.6		    vs 4.8 profit</p>
<p> Pay date		   Feb 26, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date  Dec 17</p>
<p> Ex-div date		Dec 9</p>
</text>
